897
00:41:18.560 --> 00:41:20.450
riding my motorcycle in Maine.

898
00:41:20.450 --> 00:41:21.830
But that's what we hang on to.

899
00:41:21.830 --> 00:41:26.830
And the point I'm making is that like, it wasn't all bad.

900
00:41:27.220 --> 00:41:29.233
It wasn't 100% bad.

901
00:41:30.110 --> 00:41:33.050
These tools were useful at the time, they got us through,

902
00:41:33.050 --> 00:41:34.713
like you got through law school.

903
00:41:35.580 --> 00:41:36.413
That ain't no--

904
00:41:36.413 --> 00:41:38.745
No, they work until they stop working.

