00:42:45.730 --> 00:42:48.230
I thought I was had mental illness and all this stuff.

932
00:42:48.230 --> 00:42:52.180
And it was like, "Oh, whoa, okay, really?"

933
00:42:52.180 --> 00:42:53.423
It can't be the pot.

934
00:42:55.244 --> 00:42:56.077
And I was like, okay.

935
00:42:56.077 --> 00:42:58.830
And then I just went and it was just like...

936
00:42:58.830 --> 00:43:00.713
The first one was in Atwater.

937
00:43:03.654 --> 00:43:04.494
I was like, yeah...

938
00:43:04.494 --> 00:43:07.400
(speakers talking over each other)

939
00:43:07.400 --> 00:43:11.203
No, no, it was like in a little just nondescript room.

940
00:43:12.090 --> 00:43:15.520
And man, I went back there, I went back there for like,

941
00:43:15.520 --> 00:43:17.640
I was out here for a movie premiere thing

942
00:43:17.640 --> 00:43:19.690
for a space program.

943
00:43:19.690 --> 00:43:21.250
And I went to that meeting.

